WEBVTT

00:20:25.413 --> 00:20:31.079
that I would get it myself if it couldn't
be provided for me. Sometimes I.

00:20:31.121 --> 00:20:35.788
I talk to my peers who were like going to
camp or going to Paris or whatever,

00:20:36.246 --> 00:20:39.538
and I envy them. And yet
I also think, wow,

00:20:39.871 --> 00:20:44.538
the best education I ever had was being
a janitor in my high school

00:20:44.538 --> 00:20:47.704
and then going from that job straight
to my job at the Dairy Queen.

00:20:48.121 --> 00:20:52.496
And I did that all summer and
they were minimum wage jobs.

00:20:52.496 --> 00:20:57.871
But but they were the first lesson I had
and really how to be self-sufficient

00:20:57.871 --> 00:21:01.079
and making it happen, like not expecting
others to make it happen for you.